  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the National Center for Vegetation Cover (NCVC)-UNDP-SAU-00129917</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In support to the realization of the ambitious Saudi Arabia and Middle East Green initiative under the Saudi Vision 2030, the National Center for Vegetation Cover and Combating Desertification (NCVC) has been tasked with combating desertification, rehabilitating forest vegetation cover, protecting local endangered plant species and managing national parks. This project is designed to support NCVC to increase necessary institutional, technical, and technological capacities to realize its mandate</narrative>
  </description>
